# Git LFS rules kept only for large model weights IF you ever commit BERT/BiLSTM
# (~438 MB / ~11 MB). SVM and Naive Bayes joblib artifacts are tiny (~1.4 MB)
# and are committed as regular files — no LFS needed.
*.safetensors filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pt filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
